50,3,1,talk,Asuka,,I vote for the Station Access Upgrades; the maintenance contract has the capacity we need.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Takumi,,I'll vote for the Crosstown Bus Corridor. It's better than the alternatives.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,I vote for the Integrated Fare Platform to kill those contractor fees.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Servas,,I vote for the Night Service Extension; the data from eight years ago is promising.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Jonathan,,I vote for the Crosstown Bus Corridor. Roadway consents are already delegated.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, the data terms for the fare platform are not agreed upon. It will stall.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, the staffing issue Asuka mentioned makes the night service a fantasy.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, I see the risk, but the financial bleed is the priority.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Takumi, we can always recruit, but we cannot recreate a lost opportunity.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Jonathan,,The bus corridor avoids the pre-war shells and the data disputes.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Jonathan, you're right about the shells. I might reconsider the bus corridor.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Takumi,,It's the most logical choice for moving people.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If the bus corridor uses the construction grant, it might be the safest bet.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Servas,,"I still believe in the night service, but I see the consensus shifting.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,It is the most pragmatic path forward.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I change my vote to the Crosstown Bus Corridor.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Takumi,,My vote remains the Crosstown Bus Corridor.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,4,talk,Benjamin,,I'll switch to the Crosstown Bus Corridor for the sake of the budget.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,4,talk,Servas,,I will stick with the Night Service Extension.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,4,talk,Jonathan,,My vote remains the Crosstown Bus Corridor.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
